      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Catawba River, which feeds Lake Norman, has served Native Americans and early settlers for centuries, and its name translates to \u201cpeople of the river.\u201d.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
