      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Lake Norman, North Carolina\u2019s largest man\u2011made lake, was created by a Duke Power Company dam that also supplied hydroelectric power to the surrounding region.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
